<title>FRANCE: Rouen Sept 1-18 flour exports reach 16,003 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Sept 1-18 flour exports reach 16,003 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from the French port of Rouen totalled 16,003 tonnes between September 1 and September 18, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some 14,253 tonnes of flour were destined for West Africa and 1,750 for Latvia, they said</p>
<p>Flour exports reached 52,000 tonnes in September 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
